<div n="3" type="jArticle"><head><hi rendition="#aq">d.</hi> <hi rendition="#b">Dieb&#x017F;tahl.</hi></head> <p>Bei der Firma <hi rendition="#g">Schwarz u. Weigl,</hi><lb/>
